{"id":"na9c5da9587","headline":"Rent for housing rose 16.7%","summary":"In September 2026, new housing prices in Kazakhstan rose 10.9% year on year. Secondary-market apartments rose 7.9%, while rent for improved housing rose 16.7%.","why":"Housing prices and rents are key indicators of inflation and household purchasing power. They also shape demand for construction and mortgage lending.","category":"economy","event_type":"macro-data","importance":1,"flag":null,"market_moving":false,"location":{"place":"Astana","country":"Kazakhstan","lat":51.169,"lon":71.449,"region":"asia"},"entities":[],"links":[],"source":{"name":"«Астана» телеарнасы","url":"https://astanatv.kz/kz/news/180352/"},"sources":[{"name":"«Астана» телеарнасы","url":"https://astanatv.kz/kz/news/180352/"}],"published_at":"2026-10-11T09:32:00Z","retrieved_at":"2026-11-12T07:47:41Z","official":false,"ai_summary":true,"content_hash":"b4ecef433fb7a530","impacts":[],"why_moved":null,"backfilled":true,"backfilled_at":"2026-11-12T07:47:41Z","backfill_provenance":{"version":"gdelt-backfill-v1","original_published_at":"2026-10-11T09:32:00Z","feed_url":"https://data.gdeltproject.org/gdeltv2/","discovered_via":"GDELT GKG 2.1","gdelt_seen":"2026-10-11T12:00:00Z","publisher_country_gdelt":"KZ","description_from":"publisher page metadata, translated to English by Claude"},"headline_translated":true,"original_headline":"Тұрғын үйді жалдау ақысы 16,7% қымбаттады","source_language":"kaz","image":{"kind":"topic","file":"photos/housing-construction-10344932.jpg","alt":"housing construction (illustration)","credit":"photoeightyeight","license":"Pixabay Content License","license_url":"https://pixabay.com/service/license-summary/","source":"Pixabay","source_url":"https://pixabay.com/photos/building-architecture-facade-roof-10344932/"}}